1181.0,
1771.0
],
"text": "AFW SYSTEM",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 51,
"box": [
933.0,
1793.0,
1537.0,
1835.0
],
"text": "Figure 11.5-1 Auxiliary Feedwater System",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 52,
"box": [
292.0,
1863.0,
2245.0,
1926.0
],
"text": "The major components of the AFW system are CST 12, two turbine driven AFW pumps,",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 53,
"box": [
292.0,
1929.0,
2231.0,
1986.0
],
"text": "one motor driven AFW pump, eight AFW blocking valves, four AFW flow control valves,",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 54,
"box": [
295.0,
1995.0,
2242.0,
2049.0
],
"text": "and associated piping. During normal plant operation, the AFW system is maintained in",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 55,
"box": [
294.0,
2054.0,
1833.0,
2114.0
],
"text": "a standby mode with its components lined up for automatic actuation.",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 56,
"box": [
294.0,
2143.0,
2241.0,
2200.0
],
"text": "The AFW pumps take a suction on CST 12 and discharge to four AFW lines. Two AFW",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 57,
"box": [
295.0,
2209.0,
2155.0,
2263.0
],
"text": "lines receive water from the turbine driven pumps, and two AFW lines receive water",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 58,
"box": [
292.0,
2270.0,
2241.0,
2328.0
],
"text": "from the motor driven pump. Each AFW line has two blocking valves in series, followed",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 59,
"box": [
294.0,
2333.0,
2173.0,
2392.0
],
"text": "by a flow control valve. The flow control valves are used to regulate the AFW flow to",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 60,
"box": [
295.0,
2400.0,
788.0,
2454.0
],
"text": "the steam generators.",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 61,
"box": [
292.0,
2484.0,
2207.0,
2539.0
],
"text": "After the flow control valves, each motor AFW line connects with a turbine AFW line to",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 62,
"box": [
294.0,
2552.0,
2162.0,
2606.0
],
"text": "send auxiliary feedwater to one steam generator. The AFW flowing into each steam",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 63,
"box": [
292.0,
2610.0,
2229.0,
2671.0
],
"text": "generator maintains level in the steam generator and allows removal of decay heat and",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 64,
"box": [
294.0,
2676.0,
1348.0,
2733.0
],
"text": "cool down of the reactor coolant system (RCS).",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 65,
"box": [
294.0,
2764.0,
2150.0,
2819.0
],
"text": "The purpose of the two blocking valves in each AFW line is to isolate AFW flow to a",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 66,
"box": [
294.0,
2828.0,
2060.0,
2881.0
],
"text": "steam generator when a rupture has occurred in the steam generator. The four",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 67,
"box": [
292.0,
2889.0,
2225.0,
2947.0
],
"text": "blocking valves for one steam generator shut automatically when an AFAS block signal",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 68,
"box": [
292.0,
2955.0,
1141.0,
3012.0
],
"text": "is generated for that steam generator.",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 69,
"box": [
293.0,
3071.0,
494.0,
3119.0
],
"text": "Rev 10/08",
"rot": "0"
},
{
"id": 70,
"box": [
1136.0,
3072.0,
1265.0,
3119.0
],
"text": "11.5-2",
"rot": "0"
},
{
